<title>UK: RIBS sets 225 mln Swiss franc May 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>RIBS sets 225 mln Swiss franc May 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RIBS B.V. AMSTERRDAM</p>
<p> AMT    225 MLN CHF   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6 BP     PAY DATE   S04.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPECT S&amp;P AAA	 ISS PRICE  101.337   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   FULL FEES  1.375     PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF $5 BLN COLLATERALISED MTN ISSUANCE PROG</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
